  "body": "Perfectly positioned in one of Takapuna's most desirable locations, this exceptional property presents a rare opportunity to secure a premium landholding in one of Auckland's most sought-after coastal suburbs.\r\n\r\nEnjoying beautiful views across Lake Pupuke and just moments from the golden sands of Takapuna Beach, the property is ideally located between lake and sea. Takapuna's vibrant cafés, restaurants, boutique shopping and Milford Village are all within easy reach, offering an exceptional lifestyle in a location renowned for its convenience and enduring appeal.\r\n\r\nAdding to its exceptional value, Resource Consent has already been approved for subdivision, providing an outstanding opportunity for developers, investors and owner-occupiers alike. Subject to the final design, a future home may potentially enjoy sea views, complementing the existing lake outlook and further enhancing the property's long-term value. Whether you choose to develop now or secure a premium landholding for the future, the possibilities are truly compelling.\r\n\r\nThe property also benefits from excellent motorway access, sought-after school zones, and close proximity to Auckland CBD, Smales Farm, Takapuna and Milford, making it a location that continues to attract strong demand from families, professionals and investors alike.\r\n\r\nBlue-chip opportunities of this calibre are increasingly rare. Combining a premium location, approved subdivision potential, beautiful lake views, the potential for future sea views, and an exceptional coastal lifestyle, 308 Hurstmere Road offers a unique opportunity to secure one of Takapuna's most desirable addresses.\r\n\r\nLake views. Potential sea views. Resource Consent approved. Exceptional future value.\r\n\r\n308 Hurstmere Road - where lifestyle, location and opportunity come together.",
